flowchart TB
    W[Check every tile] --> Q{Anything<br/>changed?}
    Q -- no --> S[Say nothing.<br/>Schedule the next check]
    Q -- yes --> A["Act on it<br/>A question: answer it, or take it to the owner<br/>Waiting for approval: tell the owner which tile and key<br/>Finished: read the report, start the review<br/>Going wrong: stop it, and say why"]
    A --> S
    S --> W
